Subject: [PATCH 1/9] doc: mm: describe runtime-guided memory tiering

Add documentation for the Heterogeneous Memory Control Plane, covering:
- Memory tier model (hot/warm/cold)
- Hint operations (prefetch, promote, demote, release)
- Hint lifecycle state machine
- Backend abstraction
- Design rationale for internal types, async execution, and ioctl frontend
- Tracepoints and debugfs observability

